# setuptools ships `tests/test_*.py` by default, which leaves out conftest.py and the stand-ins for
# the external programs -- so the tests in an sdist could not run. Ship all of them, and everything
# else they read: the test suite checks that the version agrees across five files, runs the two
# compatibility wrappers, and runs the example's own scripts.
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include example *.py *.sh
recursive-include recipe *.yaml
include CHANGELOG.md
include CITATION.cff
include environment.yml
include primer_finder.py
include IDT_results_converter.py
